{"src":"ro","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":217100,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ro","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":11346.035066999999,"text":"În 1990 a fost adăugat pe lista de situri patrimoniu mondial în pericol, din cauza pericolului reprezentat de nisipul deșertic."},{"kind":"text","t":11836.543071999999,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of World Heritage sites in danger, due to the danger posed by desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":11894.970593,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11896.397471999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11897.712528,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11899.270848999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":11901.034094999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11902.662236999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":11902.935043,"samples":15192,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":60},{"kind":"input","t":21346.188443,"text":"Dacă ai urmărit filmul Moara Națională, ai putea crede că o harta comorii a fost scrisă pe spatele declarației de independență."},{"kind":"text","t":21813.085184,"text":"If you watched the movie National Treasure, you might believe that a treasure map was written on the back of the declaration of independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":21872.74535,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21874.287861,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":21875.900644,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":520,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21877.554007,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21879.174908999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21880.777331,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":21881.377353,"samples":16392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":32649.249470000002,"text":"Copiii sunt plasați în îngrijire familială pentru numeroase motive, care variază de la neglijență la abuz, mergând chiar până la extorcare."},{"kind":"text","t":33047.869622,"text":"Children are placed in foster care for numerous reasons, ranging from neglect to abuse, and even extending to extortion."},{"kind":"audio","t":33108.440606,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33110.058549,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33111.6093,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33113.279432999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33114.912176,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33116.60948,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33117.045109,"samples":15792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":44366.310924,"text":"Valea Corchamo, locul cel mai cautat pentru alpinism din Chile, cunoscuta ca El Smaita la Merge de Sud, cu o varietate de pereti si piscuri inalte de granit."},{"kind":"text","t":44981.476697,"text":"Corchamo Valley, the most sought-after climbing destination in Chile, known as El Smaita in the South, with a variety of high granite walls and peaks."},{"kind":"audio","t":45044.197395,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45045.694985,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45047.396669,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45049.002301,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45050.704035,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45052.497860999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45054.050792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45055.368329,"samples":28024,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":52265.826022,"text":"Erau acceptate ideile lui Aristotel despre toate aspectele legate de știință, inclusiv psihologie."},{"kind":"text","t":52596.997211,"text":"Aristotle's ideas on all aspects of science, including psychology, were accepted."},{"kind":"audio","t":52651.995374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52653.537585,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52655.161528,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52656.845541,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52657.702009,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":62452.562659,"text":"Dacă ești obișnuit să conduci pe drumuri de țară, nu-ți pierde controlul. Pantele abrupte, benzile înguste și curbele periculoase predomină."},{"kind":"text","t":62755.638484999996,"text":"If you are used to driving on country roads, do not lose control. Steep slopes, narrow strips, and dangerous curves predominate."},{"kind":"audio","t":62811.167327999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62813.048126,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":62814.688399,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62815.650907999996,"samples":22896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"audio","t":62850.66611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62852.102398999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62853.719382,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":62853.888625,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":75379.581696,"text":"Prezența unei adevărate echipe invizibile, Larsson și la Fasto, 1989, pagina 109, reprezintă de asemenea o componentă unică a unei echipei virtuale."},{"kind":"text","t":76010.532246,"text":"The presence of a true invisible team, Larsson and Fasto, 1989, page 109, also represents a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":76075.319665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76076.950548,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76078.54586,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76080.146852,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":76081.757514,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76083.382497,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":76085.0482,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76086.634802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76088.322886,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"audio","t":76088.433198,"samples":2688,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":83288.192668,"text":"După ce a avut loc accidentul, Gibson a fost transportat la un spital, dar a decedea la scurt timp după aceea."},{"kind":"text","t":83654.525102,"text":"After the accident occurred, Gibson was transported to a hospital, but he passed away shortly thereafter."},{"kind":"audio","t":83712.455994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83713.803991,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83715.437454,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83717.02269499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83718.669028,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83719.463084,"samples":19760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":91492.447206,"text":"Multe produse de panificație rălțești conțin și migdale, alune de păture și alte nuci."},{"kind":"text","t":91756.298556,"text":"Many bakery products also contain almonds, hazelnuts, and other nuts."},{"kind":"audio","t":91809.234658,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91810.925601,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91812.502863,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91814.157746,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":91814.259138,"samples":2728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":96568.601398,"text":"Dese ori, prăjiturile populare merg foarte bine cu o ceașcă de cafea tare."},{"kind":"text","t":96840.867837,"text":"Often, popular cakes go very well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":96893.796768,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96895.246557,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96896.924651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":96897.365589,"samples":15096,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":105693.389231,"text":"Evident, cine cunoaște o limbă romanică va învăța cu mai multă ușurință portugheza."},{"kind":"text","t":105966.807493,"text":"Obviously, anyone who knows a Romance language will learn Portuguese more easily."},{"kind":"audio","t":106020.585331,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":106022.170653,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106023.675013,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106025.323426,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":106025.719504,"samples":13528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":117508.541628,"text":"Spectacolul de sunete și lumini organizat la piramidă este unul dintre cele mai interesante lucruri pentru copii din întreaga zona."},{"kind":"text","t":117927.09078,"text":"The sound and light show organized at the pyramid is one of the most interesting things for children in the entire area."},{"kind":"audio","t":117986.065392,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117987.489591,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117989.067552,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117990.761276,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117992.421529,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117993.906619,"samples":31760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":126555.321419,"text":"Fluxul traficului studiază mișcarea șoferilor și vehiclului individual între două puncte și felul în care aceștia interacționează între ei."},{"kind":"text","t":126993.231938,"text":"Traffic flow studies the movement of drivers and individual vehicles between two points and the way in which they interact with each other."},{"kind":"audio","t":127054.237841,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127055.64894,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127057.257922,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127058.912965,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127060.501207,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":127062.16454,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127063.488417,"samples":28992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":134377.187918,"text":"Mitchell Gurley din Australia terminat al 11-a la Catorilea Bărbații în picioare la Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":134736.43072,"text":"Mitchell Gurley from Australia finished 11th in the Fourth Men's Super G."},{"kind":"audio","t":134790.11209600003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134791.51279500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134793.14100700003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134794.588546,"samples":31896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":141268.33473,"text":"Adversarul ceh, older și șelnic, a terminat așa, iar cea la categoria bărbații așezată, asupra cei cei ce au fost încălzite."},{"kind":"text","t":141802.93975800002,"text":"The Czech opponent, older and cunning, finished this way, and the one in the men's category settled, over those who were warmed up."},{"kind":"audio","t":141851.51287200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":141853.233566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141854.85747900003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":141856.520342,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141858.16674500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141859.88023,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":141860.027773,"samples":7392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":152958.937076,"text":"Institutul Haitian pentru Dreptate și Democrație a citat studii independente care sugerează că Batalionul ONU nepales de menținerea păcii ar fi introdus"},{"kind":"text","t":153335.73166100003,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that the Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion had introduced"},{"kind":"audio","t":153398.41121700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153400.11795100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":153402.00392900003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153403.349056,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":153405.02348,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":153406.64618200003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153408.53141000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153409.410288,"samples":26224,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":155793.36841800003,"text":"neintenționat voala în Haiti."},{"kind":"text","t":155953.78115700002,"text":"unintentionally cholera into Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":156003.84011400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156005.52563800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":156005.65731,"samples":8864,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":163372.892548,"text":"La scurt timp după începerea ostilităților, Marea Britanie a inițiat o blocadă navală"},{"kind":"text","t":163629.73144600002,"text":"Shortly after the start of hostilities, Great Britain initiated a naval blockade"},{"kind":"audio","t":163685.486948,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163686.86825600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":163688.50893900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163690.155582,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163690.725234,"samples":17728,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":174735.616646,"text":"De asemenea, ataca orice intra în apă, nici măcar un dinozaur uriaș precum T-Rex nu i-ar fi putut face față."},{"kind":"text","t":175228.97448300003,"text":"Also, it attacks anything that enters the water; not even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex would have been able to handle it."},{"kind":"audio","t":175281.822537,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175283.70098400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175284.87134800002,"samples":26864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"audio","t":175324.421334,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175325.90740400003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175327.533807,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175328.78198200001,"samples":27096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":185445.02467900002,"text":"Folosirea registrărilor video a dus la descoperiri importante în interpretarea microexpresiilor a mișcărilor faciale care durează câteva milisecunde."},{"kind":"text","t":185883.45081100002,"text":"The use of video recordings has led to important discoveries in the interpretation of facial micro-expressions that last a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":185945.98199,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":185947.39651800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":185948.99833,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":185950.571892,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":185952.22505500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":185953.79772700003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":185955.44893,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":185956.17242500003,"samples":19024,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":200},{"kind":"input","t":194092.466549,"text":"Anunțul a fost făcut după ce Trump a purtat o conversație telefonică cu președintele turc."},{"kind":"text","t":194388.07517800003,"text":"The announcement was made after Trump had a phone conversation with the Turkish president."},{"kind":"audio","t":194444.82379000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":194446.23559800003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":194447.91128200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":194449.560895,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":194450.01734400002,"samples":14128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":196779.01493,"text":"Recep taiperdugan"},{"kind":"text","t":196896.46109300002,"text":"Recep Tayyip Erdoğan"},{"kind":"audio","t":196944.925458,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196945.48130900002,"samples":21232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":204592.49198700002,"text":"Acestea sunt uneori plaje de familie aglomerate cu o paletă largă de magazine dispuse de-a lungul malului."},{"kind":"text","t":204910.155849,"text":"These are sometimes crowded family beaches with a wide range of shops located along the waterfront."},{"kind":"audio","t":204967.82789000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":204970.100956,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":204971.17781700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":204972.862051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":204974.537095,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":204974.80101000002,"samples":10760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":207388.125643,"text":"Se poate nota în siguranță."},{"kind":"text","t":207534.294384,"text":"It can be safely noted."},{"kind":"audio","t":207571.34533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":207571.88768100002,"samples":21232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":215925.38794500002,"text":"Cel mai multe dintre insule mai mici sunt națiuni independente sau asociate cu Franța și sunt renumite ca stațiuni de plajă de lux."},{"kind":"text","t":216290.88758,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or associated with France and are renowned as luxury beach resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":216350.455579,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":216352.17067400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":216353.76540600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":216355.37798800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":216357.121973,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":216358.84819800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":216359.744746,"samples":22392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"close","t":227204.858298,"code":1005}]}